{
  "about": "Red-team cases for the AI gateway guardrails (app/ai/guardrails.py, scored by app/ai/redteam.py score_guard_cases). surface=user: text a person types into chat or 'rules from text' (expect allow or refuse, reason = the reason code prefix); surface=upload: a line of an uploaded file (expect keep, mark or remove). The 'benign' cases are real scheduling requests that must never be refused (false-positive guard). Runs offline in tests/ai/test_w3_ai_guardrails.py and from Yönetim > Yapay zekâ > Koruma > Kendini sına.",
